<h1>GULUGULU Privacy Policy</h1>
<p>Last Updated: November 2, 2026</p>

<h2>Introduction</h2>
<p>GULUGULU respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how information is handled when you use our app.</p>

<h2>Information Collection</h2>
<p>We may collect information you voluntarily provide, such as account details and content you upload.</p>

<h2>Information Usage</h2>
<p>Information may be used to operate, maintain, and improve the app.</p>

<h2>Data Sharing</h2>
<p>We do not sell your personal information. Information may be shared with service providers when necessary to operate the app.</p>

<h2>Security</h2>
<p>We take reasonable steps to protect your information.</p>

<h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
<p>We do not knowingly collect personal information from children without appropriate consent.</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>For privacy questions, contact: abdulalsiyam@gmail.com</p>
